---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Contact
description: Contact the Molosser International Association about registration, appraisals or a registered dog.
lead: Questions about registration, appraisals or a registered dog? Send us a message and we'll reply within [N] business days.
---
<div class="contact">
  {#- The form posts nowhere yet. Step 4 adds a Worker endpoint with Turnstile spam protection. #}
  <form class="card form" action="#" method="post">
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Name<input name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required></label>
      <label>Email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></label>
    </div>
    <label>Topic
      <select name="topic">
        <option>Registration</option>
        <option>Appraisal events</option>
        <option>Verifying a dog</option>
        <option>Ethics concern</option>
        <option>Other</option>
      </select>
    </label>
    <label>Registration number <span class="muted">(optional)</span><input name="registration" type="text" placeholder="MIA-BB-00000"></label>
    <label>Message<textarea name="message" rows="6" required></textarea></label>
    <button class="button" type="submit" disabled>Send message</button>
    <p class="muted small">The form goes live soon. Until then, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email.info }}">{{ site.email.info }}</a>.</p>
  </form>

  <aside class="contact-aside">
    <img class="seal" src="/assets/img/mia-seal-dark.png" alt="Molosser International Association seal, established 2020" width="220" height="220">
    <div><span class="label">Email</span><a href="mailto:{{ site.email.info }}">{{ site.email.info }}</a></div>
    <div><span class="label">Phone</span><span>{{ site.phone }}</span><span class="muted small">{{ site.hours }}</span></div>
    <p class="note">Reporting an ethics concern? Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email.ethics }}">{{ site.email.ethics }}</a>, and see how complaints are handled in the <a href="/code-of-ethics/">Code of Ethics</a>.</p>
  </aside>
</div>
